 "remarks": "Welcome to 116 William Street! Bright, inviting, and beautifully updated, this 4-bedroom, 2.5-bath home is filled with natural light. The comfortable, welcoming living spaces are ideal for everyday living and entertaining. The finished lower level provides wonderful additional living space, complete with a cozy fireplace and sliding doors opening directly to the backyard-perfect for a family room, recreation space, or relaxing with friends. New Hardie board siding adds to the home's curb appeal and offers lasting durability with low maintenance. Ideally located on the Norwalk-Westport border, with convenient access to shopping, dining, beaches, and commuter routes, this home offers the best of both towns. Beautifully maintained, thoughtfully updated, and truly move-in ready-all that's left to do is unpack and enjoy!",
